///
/// \file
/// Runtime requirements unsupported by this PE loader profile. Each field must
/// remain zero. Size, timestamp, version and SecurityCookie are handled by the
/// loader directly. Define LOAD_FIELD(Name) before including this file.
///
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//

